      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Alpha Matte — closed-form (Levin 2008) matting from a trimap.\n\nTrimap Builder turns the subject mask into sure-foreground / unknown / sure-background; Alpha Matte solves the unknown band against the photo so hair strands get partial alpha. The image is downscaled to 25% first: matting cost grows with the unknown area, so work at preview size, then refine. compute_device = auto stays on CPU for CPU images (portable); pick cuda on an NVIDIA GPU for ~5x speed."
      ]
    }
